# Core

- Talk in plain language. Prefer short checklists.
- Prefer small diffs. Do not rewrite files you were not asked to touch.
- Do not invent APIs, ticket IDs, requirements, or design details.
- Ask when unsure. Wait for an answer before guessing.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, API keys, tokens). Never put tokens in chat or in committed files.
- Do not commit unless the user asks.
